          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="25790230">MaybeSunshine</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP726 Banff Coach Road [FOUND]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Awesome! And I thought the border monuments were large. Also, the log by Ken (RIP) for this one gave me a chuckle. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of cap find makes me glad I’m still catching up on these even if almost everyone else left the party years ago. Really helped make my day.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="683862768">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-05-05T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="7573673">geoCurious2</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP726 - Banff Coach Road&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Having discovered that we actually had a few more days to record Brass Caps, we went out today to get some more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Never seen the likes of this before!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="684223617">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-05-03T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="3061435">Iron Phoenix</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP726 - Banff Coach Road&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Out for another day of capping and caching with OBA, picking up ones we didn't get to earlier! &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_big.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt; A busy day today and lots of walking, but a lot of fun!! &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_big.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt; This was the most unusual and unique cap I've found! Getting close to the end of the capping day, so a nice quick one! &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_big.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt; TFTCap!!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="683872601">
