          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="540154">One Bad Ant</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP726 - Banff Coach Road - Wow, that's quite the cap! I even spotted it from the car :) &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Iron Phoenix and I spent the day continuing our Calgary and area capping spree. Thanks for the work you do maintaining the caps outforthehunt.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="683269574">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-05-02T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="12442378">mikefromcanmore</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP726 Banff Coach Road  Last stop on the drive home to Canmore from Edmonton.  Had been saving this one as have driven by the area many times.  Never did find a cap but 2 separate survey posts.  One very old and very small and the other very large and much more modern.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
